a, and uses it to increase the blow damage by 100%% of it.\n\t\tThe chance to instantly kill will increase with your Physical Power.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"试图施展一次致命打击，造成 %d%% 武器伤害，本次攻击自动变成暴击。\n\t\t如果打击后目标生命值低于 20%% 则有可能直接杀死。\n\t\t在等级 4 时会消耗剩余的耐力值的一半并增加 100%% 所消耗耐力值的伤害。\n\t\t目标即死的概率受物理强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1f95763d74e8dabf72a0fa1588197a1b7b889f6a481dd2292dc63d102bb40995","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"51378f945f75a6faa007e1a90dcddc9437b354eb90bf2ae6a2cc2491baec857e","logical_entry_identity":"b7f85fd854ffa36b84ba4c3b8ffc1ae5440e6090b6593555f8e000c8a13def86","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"All creature talent levels increased by 170%","source_tag":"_t","target":"所有生物技能等级增加 170%"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c6192b65dfdc89f8e0cdc457de841cf550e6494cd4301c43bd1d7a88460ec1d8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"513c54754a785da86cc2c14cbf3ba789b6af10467a0105d51d4c64163c204d9c","logical_entry_identity":"9b138ed1d47dc85f9be84886bf61c22d4529d0f803b15edb7503ded38cb77f85","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD#Status resistance#LAST#\nMost bad status effects can be avoided by having an appropriate immunity, represented by a percent chance to completely avoid the effect in question.  This chance is applied in addition to any saving throws or other checks that may apply.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#状态免疫#LAST#\n大部分状态效果可以被特定的免疫来抵消，以百分比表示你完全免疫该效果的几率。这一几率会与任何适用的豁免或其他判定叠加计算。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bb0cd5d2c239c9dddaa5eb5597acd11bb2757acb18e77eb09eebf0de4c6d2510","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"513c8bf1f20024ed3e9e00f12e54ca7e0c4633c17c07daf03d21b5bb1bf4689b","logical_entry_identity":"606f25ebeedff85ab784feccd78bb4932cfb406161580c22c7328f9300a11c98","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"ziguranth patrol","source_tag":"entity name","target":"伊格兰斯巡逻队"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"52ca0468fd5d4ac3ce126698b548f872150a4b292f47f0c9b434e8dbea596c66","component