be taught the secrets of the arcane.","source_tag":"_t","target":"好吧，假如你坚持的话……\n我是个法师学徒，你可能已经看出来了。我的目标是得到安格利文人的接纳，向他们学习奥术的秘密。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"91641b431c8ee21ab12e52ae02708dcb3d7744b78fbb88eda80e741a566c4e58","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5148874be725500e76f3ec94f150d5b257ee5f05f32fd63fe2bd453cd33545dd","logical_entry_identity":"82071e47b2cdbf49811cce0510a2bedf764525ef3bac1599d97d307880a38457","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Damage Smearing","source_tag":"_t","target":"时空转化"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"830d24634e2e5367da6411a9015bd4bd4744c7c17ae4ab9274eb1fa3f6dbde7e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5148ebf66173d7c0f5dfdd48bd29eb8eb3791659daabd231775866ea5d30783f","logical_entry_identity":"8ee1ec7b52264b0fc719e03a30b7d9e5e1b32cff98af72062058c470180a1308","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Perhaps there's something that I can help you with.","source_tag":"_t","target":"也许我能帮上什么忙。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"813fba777ea6ccd2f3d4adf5412372b9582aea750e57443491422d1bd88fb0ce","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"514a52cccb1d1ab558c63fda180d0c360f5916918d53f6f7ee62062e271002e3","logical_entry_identity":"1656fb3df34aef2789bdd63d7f5efc5685e7639ab388d216a720d3bec5f8333b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Bind the target mercilessly with constant, bone-shattering pressure, pinning and slowing it by 50%% for %d turns and dealing %0.1f Physical damage each turn.\n\t\tThe duration and damage improve with Mindpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"用粉碎骨头的力量紧紧锁住目标，定身并减速目标 50%%，持续 %d 回合，每回合造成 %0.1f 物理伤害。\n\t\t持续时间和伤害受精神强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6cd32848a1d2d4026e7f9ec0046437255bd172f75b877b010ca0a15804ba4523","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"51543a41b15047e967dc19fa302291c389ba7b8b2aa5ac095963d64563e7ca2e","logical_entry_identity":"8695e5b5ccd8a8130a23af3b9403196d53ab95113b529938d4503f350d5176ca","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Hit Penalty","source_tag":"_t","target":"双手惩罚"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"12caa07a712e95f83b0d630d515071d96fccc1b5a5c0a46b2c7132949f4d6899","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5155e7afc0c371e48b34640a93651e60a1ef816db7a568ff1d6e407a626b7ab3","logical_entry_identity":"c85c9928af5c8e636b90b011dbf0d057783ed0556b4fcd04dbd16db81a69bdaa","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#{italic}#68th of Dusk, Year of Pyre 710#{normal}#\nThe orcish tribe have routed us. We have retreated to some Mardrop ruins and secured ourselves amongst the fortifications. I have just shy of 2,000 men under my banner, some of the best warriors I have ever served with, but we are simply no match for the numbers we face. Counting them is difficult, but I would put a minimum estimate at 10,000. The tribe has camped a league away - they seem to be waiting for reinforcements. This does not bode well...\n\nI have sent messenger crows to all the kingdoms. I can but hope they send aid in time.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{italic}#烈火纪710年，黄昏月68日#{normal}#\n兽人部落击溃了我们。我们已退至马卓普的一处遗迹，依托其中的工事据守。我麾下不足两千人，其中不乏我并肩作战过的最出色战士，可面对如此数量的敌人，我们实在无力匹敌。敌军难以清点，但至少有一万。兽人部落在一里格之外扎下营寨——他们似乎正在等待增援。这可不是好兆头……\n\n我已派信鸦前往所有王国。只盼他们的援军能及时赶到。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"653053d3c53a9e4e189c8b5c39701f5d9c8091257ec9e766772760f179a8b33c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"516175d6c0e79150c153113b512a39755422c01068acb423c0023282d508ab0d","logical_entry_identity":"ddf9bf7b7b4249dfaee56674ff9a7ff77c8d4dae1a87027d6ced11a66ce3cefb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Spelldrinker","source_tag":"entity name","target":"饮法者"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"57237d0d3ec59d7b3661666266ad7fd906019625153b2ec98796a1b1f8c0f584","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"516a6613a662e228dd97c20069a9d06b624c53ad37cedf116bc8940198915a65","logical_entry_identity":"605ad2ab5ffd00facc570979763663777c946c46c0a904c36cc4bef56da7c419","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You do not have the summoning scroll!",